{
  "name": "dos_msc3",
  "about": "Microsoft C 3.00 - 5.1's DOS library: as dos_c_early, but with text mode (\\n written \\r\\n to text files and the console, \\r\\n read as \\n), open()'s O_TEXT/O_BINARY",
